Package: irdastyle
Type: Package
Title: IRDA Visual Identity Themes for 'ggplot2', 'gt', 'flextable',
    'echarts4r' and 'DT'
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Cédric", "Bouffard", email = "80600509+cedricbouffard@users.noreply.github.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a consistent set of colours, palettes and themes that
    apply the visual identity of the IRDA (Institut de recherche et de
    développement en agroenvironnement) to common R outputs. The package
    ships 'ggplot2' themes and discrete colour/fill scales, a 'gt' table
    theme, a 'flextable' theme, an 'echarts4r' theme and a 'DT' datatable
    helper, all built on a single shared colour palette.
